Subject: [PATCH v9 3/5] arm64: dts: nuvoton: npcm845: Add peripheral nodes
Date: Mon,  3 Aug 2026 14:19:04 +0300
Message-Id: <20260803111906.1931384-4-tmaimon77@gmail.com>
